Conclusion
Dysphagia
,
dysphonia
,
and
dysarthria
were
widespread
among
adults
hospitalized
with
COVID-19
and
they
persisted
for
many
at
discharge
.
Prompt
SLT
evaluation
is
required
to
minimize
complications
.
